notes={(136,5):'The BEARS About page describes vehicle telematics and explicitly names BEARS LLC in its leadership biographies.',(136,9):'The official site describes autonomous ocean-data systems and names Bedrock Ocean Exploration, PBC in its footer. Public-benefit corporate form does not establish stock-market listing or nonprofit status.',(136,21):'The official Bench in a Box page names its Bay City location and diagnostic-platform development. Performance targets do not establish clinical approval or demonstrated efficacy.',(136,29):'Betterment explicitly names Betterment LLC as its investment adviser and separately identifies its broker-dealer, bank and other service entities.',(136,37):'The Bilt housing-rewards site names Bilt Technologies, Inc. in its footer. This is distinct from the similarly named 3D-instruction software business.',(136,40):'BioFactura’s own page identifies the company and drug-development/manufacturing services. Identity verification does not establish approval of pipeline products.',(136,41):'The official BioLab page explicitly identifies it as the swimming-pool and spa water-care division of KIK Consumer Products.',(136,53):'The official legal disclosure names BitGo, Inc. and distinguishes it from BitGo Holdings, Inc. and BitGo Bank & Trust. Group stock-listing and bank-charter claims are not assigned to this operating entity.',(136,56):'The official site distinguishes the East Oakland cultural zone, its collaborative and its nonprofit community-development corporation. The description retains that scope rather than collapsing every partner into one legal entity.',(136,71):'Bleu Garde’s product page explicitly states that its SARS-CoV-2 emergency exemption ended January 14, 2023. Pending applications are not current approvals.',(136,73):'The official BCBS Michigan site identifies its health-insurance services and states nonprofit corporate status in its footer. This source does not separately substantiate the proposed mutual classification.',(136,74):'The official About page explicitly identifies Blue Earth Diagnostics as a subsidiary of Bracco Imaging and describes PET radiopharmaceutical development.',(136,78):'The company About page describes carbon-storage infrastructure development and explicitly identifies Blue Sky as a Blackstone portfolio company; planned infrastructure is not assumed complete.',(136,79):'The official About page states Blue Star NBR was founded to establish domestic nitrile-rubber production. Its stated goal does not prove current production volumes.',(137,13):'The official licensing page explicitly identifies B.S.D. Capital, Inc. dba Lendistry, NMLS 1945565, and its Los Angeles headquarters.',(137,19):'Women’s Health Advocates explicitly describes Breast Cancer Early Detection Coalition activities and its screening-access advocacy. The coalition is not recast as the entire host organization.',(137,21):'The official Breitling imprint names Breitling SA, its Grenchen address and Swiss registry identifier CHE-102.177.526.',(137,66):'Bye Aerospace’s official site describes its eFlyer development program. Marketing performance estimates and order counts are not treated as independent verification or certification.',(137,86):'The coalition’s own site identifies its recycling-business advocacy. Its predictions about SB 811 are political claims, not findings adopted by the directory.',(137,95):'The association’s own page identifies its pharmacy membership and certification program. Association certification is not treated as government approval or a guarantee of pharmacy safety.'}
for batch in [136,137]:
 xs=json.load(open(r/f'verified-sites{batch}-next100-review.json'))
